# Title: Execute From Alternate Data Streams
# ID: 7f43c430-5001-4f8b-aaa9-c3b88f18fa5c
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2021-09-01
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
# Description: Detects execution from an Alternate Data Stream (ADS). Adversaries may use NTFS file attributes to hide their malicious data in order to evade detection
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*txt:*) AND (((process.command_line:*esentutl * AND process.command_line:* /y * AND process.command_line:* /d * AND process.command_line:* /o *)) OR ((process.command_line:*makecab * AND process.command_line:*.cab*)) OR ((process.command_line:*reg * AND process.command_line:* export *)) OR ((process.command_line:*regedit * AND process.command_line:* /E *)) OR ((process.command_line:*type * AND process.command_line:* > *))))
